include README.md
include LICENSE
include pyproject.toml

# 资源文件不走 package-data 的 sdist 路径：package-data 只影响 wheel，
# sdist 需要 MANIFEST.in 才能把 assets 打进源码包。缺了它，从 sdist 安装会得到
# 一个没有任何图片/字体/事件表的插件（R-08）。
recursive-include nonebot_plugin_xiuxian_signin/assets *
recursive-include nonebot_plugin_xiuxian_signin py.typed
recursive-include scripts *.py
